stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> home

    home --> login_username: Log in
    home --> signup_username: Sign up

    login_username --> login_password: username submitted
    login_password --> login_otp: active user + valid password
    login_password --> login_username: invalid / inactive / unknown
    login_otp --> login_otp: invalid, expired, or exhausted OTP
    login_otp --> authenticated: valid login OTP consumed
    authenticated --> home: logout

    signup_username --> signup_email: username accepted
    signup_email --> signup_password: email accepted
    signup_password --> signup_confirm: password hash stored in draft
    signup_confirm --> signup_password: mismatch
    signup_confirm --> signup_otp: matching confirmation
    signup_otp --> signup_otp: invalid, expired, or exhausted OTP
    signup_otp --> login_username: valid signup OTP activates account

    login_otp --> home: route guard failure
    signup_otp --> home: route guard failure
    authenticated --> home: direct access after logout

    note right of login_otp
      purpose = login
      user must be active
    end note

    note right of signup_otp
      purpose = signup
      successful use activates user
      and never authenticates session
    end note
